# Vile Entomber: "Deathtouch" (CR 702.2) Turn 3: Bot1's 2/2 attacks and Bot2's Hill Giant (3/3) blocks it. The Entomber deals only 2 damage, less than the Giant's toughness, but any damage from
# a deathtouch source is lethal (CR 702.2b, 704.5h): the Giant dies, and so does the Entomber (3 damage on a 2/2). The ETB search takes a Memnite out of the library into the graveyard first.

